    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "ONLY PAN AMERICAN OFFERS the luxury of non-stop sleeper service from New York to\nLondon! Four-engine Constellation-type Clippers fly you smoothly and swiftly above\nthe weather\"... have comfortable reclining seats as well as roomy, bedsize berthe\nFinest and Fastest\nService to Europe\nNEW YORK TO\nLONDON\nNEW YORK TO\nLISBON\nMONSTEr 13¾\nHOURS\nONE STOP 13½\nHOURs\nLONDON will he host to the 48 Olymnic Games this summer. Plan\nnow to stop over and see them. From London, eastward, Pan Amer-\n: daily service to Brussels, Frankfurt, Prague, Vienna. Also\nregular flights to Istanbul, India, and around-the-world.\nPARIS in June is something to remember! This great city is accessible\non the Pan American World Airways system From erner London\nor Lisbon (see map below).\nOr minnes by connectine air.\nline, from Brussels. Fare from New York (via London) S370.\nNEW YORK\nLONDON\nBRUSSELS\nROME\nLISBON\nBY THE ROUTES shown above, Pan American offers the\nfastest service to both London and Lisbon. Other\nlines show routes of the Pan American System on\nthe continent of Europe. FARES from New\nYork (subject to change): London $350.\nLisbon $356. Extra charge for berths.\nTONDON, BY FLYING CLIPPER, is now only\n/ a good night's sleep away from New\nYork! You step aboard a big 4-engine\nConstellation carly in the evening...\nsleep in a big, wide, full-size berth as you\nfly non-stop to the British Isles. and\narrive, rested and relaxed, in time for\nlunch the very next day!\nThis new luxury service to London is\noffered only by Pan American. The Flying\nClippers lead the way, too, with the fastest\nservice to Lisbon. And from either London\nor Lisbon (see map) you can continue on\nto Paris by the 4-engine Constellations of\nthe Pan American System.\nMake your Flying Clipper reservations\nto Europe now. Call your Travel Agent or\nthe nearest Pan American office.\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS"
